| 6 | Infrastructure: TLS, network exposure, cloud IAM, container and Kubernetes hardening | Networking, Cloud, Kubernetes |
| 7 | OWASP Top 10 review and a security review of the main project | |
| 8 | Threat model, incident response lab, final review | |

